- SwiftlyS2 (https://github.com/swiftly-solution/swiftlys2), GNU GPL
  version 3, with the same exception.
- Metamod:Source (https://github.com/alliedmodders/metamod-source),
  Copyright Metamod:Source Development Team, zlib/libpng License.
- SourceMod (https://github.com/alliedmodders/sourcemod), for CS:GO
  servers, GNU GPL version 3 with the SourceMod exceptions.
- AddonsManager (https://github.com/SwiftlyS2-Plugins/AddonsManager),
  GNU GPL version 3.
- NoLobbyReservation by nuxencs
  (https://github.com/nuxencs/NoLobbyReservation). Its repository states
  no license.
- The .NET runtime and Microsoft.Extensions packages
  (https://github.com/dotnet), MIT License.

The gamedata validator (apps/gamedata-validator) is adapted from
swiftly-solution/gamedata-validator
(https://github.com/swiftly-solution/gamedata-validator), whose repository
states no license. Its image includes:

- s2binlib (https://github.com/swiftly-solution/s2binlib), GNU GPL
  version 3, as the prebuilt lib/s2binlib.so, whose source is in that
  repository. The Python binding s2binlib.py comes from
  swiftly-solution/gamedata-validator.
- json5 for Python (https://github.com/dpranke/pyjson5), Apache License
  2.0.

The images are based on Valve's Steam Runtime (sniper). Counter-Strike 2
is downloaded from Steam at run time under Valve's terms and is not
distributed with the images.
